{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nxBamxUHSA1793616781.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產蔚藍灣畔第二分行副分區營業經理關偉豪表示，中原最新促成一宗將軍澳維景灣畔交投，單位為5座中層B室，實用面積511平方呎，採兩房一廁間隔，單位座向東方，可享開揚市景及海景，最新以803萬元沽出，折合實用呎價15714元。</p><p> </p><p>中原地產關偉豪指，原業主早於2002年5月僅以260萬元入市單位，持貨已經24年半，現轉手賬面可大幅獲利543萬元離場，單位升值超過2倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.541417+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:34.640178+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:48.462273+00:00","content_hash":"13f339b355d1cc778e624e425ca1705465d1dd355d46e91a8792d93707aa7188","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}